{"kind":"artifact","text":"Thread railway lane layout at exact clean head 0fa7474b3cd958c95b0d7349931571fad7a954c1 on task/ui-thread-event-railway. Lanes are recycled on the pattern Railway.tsx already uses — a lane holds the event it expects next and is reclaimed when that event lands — and the rail is capped at ten lanes, with lane nine reserved for folded branches. Folding is sticky: a folded node books no lane, so its replies fold with it and the shared lane reads as one bundle.","body":{"commit":"0fa7474b3cd958c95b0d7349931571fad7a954c1","path":"ui/src/lib/threadRailway.ts"}}